4","priority":5,"questId":23005,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":230050401,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":2280319930,"text":"Uh...","nextNodeIds":[230050402]},{"nodeId":230050402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1479169002,"text":"Hi! Hatim, how have you been?","nextNodeIds":[230050403]},{"nodeId":230050403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":2185309338,"text":"Oh... It's you guys.","nextNodeIds":[230050404]},{"nodeId":230050404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":600850226,"text":"Well, I guess you can tell from my expression, no?","nextNodeIds":[230050405]},{"nodeId":230050405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":1366839410,"text":"I'll be honest, my wallet has been rendered half empty.","nextNodeIds":[230050406]},{"nodeId":230050406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":1554214634,"text":"Strange... This isn't how things should have gone...","nextNodeIds":[230050407]},{"nodeId":230050407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":3765589898,"text":"But then again... I have a suspicion that this is a sign that the market's about to take off.","nextNodeIds":[230050408]},{"nodeId":230050408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":3681881858,"text":"It's like how people have to bend down before they can leap high.","nextNodeIds":[230050409]},{"nodeId":230050409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":1841654962,"text":"The same goes for the futures trading market. The entire market just fell to an all-time low and it's about to bottom out!","nextNodeIds":[230050410]},{"nodeId":230050410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":2459121474,"text":"In other words, now is the best time to go bargain-hunting!","nextNodeIds":[230050411,230050412]},{"nodeId":230050411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2274320938,"text":"Maybe it hasn't hit the bottom yet...","nextNodeIds":[230050413]},{"nodeId":230050413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":1894353098,"text":"No. I am pretty sure this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance, and Hatim never misses any chance to gain wealth.","nextNodeIds":[230050414]},{"nodeId":230050414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":694512682,"text":"That would be worthy of my name as Kalimi's exceptionally wealthy Hatim!","nextNodeIds":[230050415]},{"nodeId":230050415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":3273224154,"text":"Come, friend, help me out one more time, will you? Please choose another \"Golden Dish\"!","nextNodeIds":[230050416]},{"nodeId":230050416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":584762850,"text":"Still from the original options?","nextNodeIds":[230050417]},{"nodeId":230050417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":1125111698,"text":"Hm... Wait, no! Since we're going bargain-hunting, I need a dish that is extra special to turn the tide on the market.","nextNodeIds":[230050418]},{"nodeId":230050418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":795130594,"text":"I heard that Mondstadt has a tycoon who runs a super profitable alcohol business...","nextNodeIds":[230050419]},{"nodeId":230050419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1312326778,"text":"Do you mean...","nextNodeIds":[230050420]},{"nodeId":230050420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1438308554,"text":"Master Diluc?","nextNodeIds":[230050421]},{"nodeId":230050421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2898691562,"text":"But how did you know about...","nextNodeIds":[230050422]},{"nodeId":230050422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":3779252994,"text":"Hahaha, how could I not know of him, when I even know about \"Pile 'Em Up\"?","nextNodeIds":[230050423]},{"nodeId":230050423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":3923020306,"text":"He owns a tavern where they sell something wonderful known as Apple Cider. If I down some of that, I believe I shall imbibe some of his affinity for wealth as well!","nextNodeIds":[230050424]},{"nodeId":230050424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4004,"speakerName":"Hatim","textMapHash":3653082154,"text":"So please, help me get a bottle of Apple Cider!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230050412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2542549658,"text":"Some people get leg cramps when they bend low...","nextNodeIds":[230050413]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2300504,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4004"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2300505,"order":8,"stepDescription":"Help Hatim prepare an Apple Cider","stepDescTextMapHash":4245692964,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2300505,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_ITEM_GIVING","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALN